      "side": 1,
      "message": "* **Firmware Prefix Extraction (`iap_control.cc`):** The logic `uint8_t fw_ver_google \u003d fw_ver_info-\u003efw_ver \u003e\u003e 8;` shifts the 32-bit version right by 8 bits and casts it to an 8-bit integer, isolating bits 8–15. If the `0x10` prefix represents the most significant byte (e.g., `0x10XXXXXX`), this shift must be `\u003e\u003e 24`. If the device explicitly structures the version with `0x10` at bits 8–15, add a comment clarifying this unusual layout to prevent future regressions.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 112,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 112,
        "endChar": 51
      },
